## 文本文件按仓库里的 LF 统一，检出时保持原样
* text=auto

## Windows 工程文件用 CRLF，避免 VS 反复改
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.props text eol=crlf
*.targets text eol=crlf

## 二进制：不做任何换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.pfx binary
*.cer binary
